    given-names: "Jean-François"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-9778-5374"
    affiliation: "Spark AI NLP"
version: 1.0.1
date-released: "2026-10-08"
license: AGPL-3.0-only
repository-code: "https://github.com/sparkainlp-x/web-delta-feed"
abstract: "Offline, standard-library-only prototype that compares two already-saved UTF-8 text snapshots and writes a deterministic JSON report of exact added and removed lines, SHA-256 hashes of the bytes read, and literal focus-term matches; it never fetches the recorded source URL and does not interpret changes."
keywords:
  - diff
  - text-snapshots
  - change-detection
  - json
  - offline
